{"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "377978390272490"}], "release_date": 1776264360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "26487178037580577", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "26487177984247249", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1568259901589334"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "965357809361260", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Willkommen an Ihrem pers\u00f6nlichen virtuellen Strand. Entfliehen Sie dem Alltag mit Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR verwandelt das klassische Kartenspiel in einen entspannenden Kurzurlaub. Stellen Sie sich vor: Sie sitzen an einer ruhigen Bucht, \u00fcber Ihnen leuchtet der Sternenhimmel, sanftes Meeresrauschen umgibt Sie, und aus einem kleinen Strandradio klingt entspannte Musik. Vor Ihnen schwebt Ihr Solit\u00e4r-Spiel direkt \u00fcber den sanften Wellen.\n\n**Maritimes Design trifft auf magische Atmosph\u00e4re**\nJedes Detail wurde mit Liebe zum Meer gestaltet. Entdecken Sie unsere einzigartigen, Bildkarten \u2013 von der majest\u00e4tischen Meeresk\u00f6nigin bis hin zu Poseidon selbst.\n\n**Greifbare VR-Physik statt flacher Klicks**\nDank unserer nativen, hochperformanten Engine sp\u00fcren Sie jede Bewegung:\n* Perfektes Greifen: Greifen Sie Karten oder ganze Stapel intuitiv mit Ihren H\u00e4nden oder Controllern. Haptisches Feedback l\u00e4sst Sie das Gewicht der Karten f\u00f6rmlich sp\u00fcren.\n* Der \"Ninja Flick\": Verbringen Sie keine Zeit mit langweiligem Ablegen. Werfen Sie die Karten mit einem leichten Schwung aus dem Handgelenk quer \u00fcber den Tisch in ihre Ziel-Slots! \n* Volle Kontrolle: Ziehen Sie das gesamte Spielfeld mit den schwebenden Steuergriffen genau in die Position, die f\u00fcr Sie am bequemsten ist.\n\n**Vier Klassiker an einem Strand**\nSpielen Sie Ihre absoluten Lieblingsmodi, perfekt angepasst f\u00fcr die Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramide", "short_description": "Entspannendes Strand-Solit\u00e4r in VR. Lausche dem sanften Meeresrauschen, greife die Karten mit deinen eigenen H\u00e4nden und genie\u00dfe die Magie."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BSVR1440x1440.png", "id": "2265746220908120", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_2265746224241453_8663149544726326029_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3sUSUYuc7z4Q7kNvwE1SN3_&_nc_oc=Adofat8PJ0sVJoUCW5esgBJQh-u3_ZpjkQzF-0RHfZTjUSHKdWGjCVHPPPKWtUovIt0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8lFcmOTM7klEaEhb-yTFcHQWSFt8UNqdUNZWdjg4gcOg&oe=6A368E03"}, {"file_name": "bams_icon.png", "id": "1853345692009190", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1853345695342523_4969261726722226581_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=17eVFq84OSgQ7kNvwEwTlH8&_nc_oc=AdqQlevib_Yq2TKorP-Q7ZZoQqPhT51mREDec8-GXkMrqs45Si4HZy7gKiJNGbHygxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8-Rh48e6C3Nf9v2GKBO6ompBk6VogSXgi3tvUewSSpeQ&oe=6A369B20"}, {"file_name": "BSVR1008x1440.png", "id": "1280206627403407", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1280206630736740_1767039078555120883_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=senkDxMZNdAQ7kNvwGMtwnB&_nc_oc=Adrr2qWDzu0mbThK3QuenZh6N6WeaX4Gsa4Se_vS-7nQ3HyubURF8Oxb1Tm9ejhSAjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9JTZ2fMk-p7LLeZCCH5OD-Zkt1_PxL5LE0AZBVxER7GA&oe=6A36A9D8"}, {"file_name": "BSVR2560x1440.png", "id": "1240424004917207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_1240424008250540_5120684943954837147_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zIR2Tf7EOTwQ7kNvwEOyPxc&_nc_oc=AdqfOwwNOs7b2kVZ8ZHbPzvZy08tJ3pISccRGghQd19119d1kL0lI5qx9yv-5JNDpsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_us6pTG6ok4FaMZIS1OSvX3oooUGZRSWt9_UgitdNxyQ&oe=6A36AD16"}, {"file_name": "Hero Art BSVR.png", "id": "933944619503893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_933944626170559_4723201925290549549_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-3L2A4FusIQ7kNvwEuXGDO&_nc_oc=AdpQjyj6_L93-yEnMYBzBq9c1nirtF4DQJdxYQDc_eP4S5j9jH1aVVNxn-HSnVwdM38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_c2dL25-P14Fr6LfmPTvNKr_oyNrZ0cRyvPTGkrA0DEA&oe=6A369C70"}, {"file_name": "bams_logo_meta.png", "id": "793646677155197", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_793646680488530_2105530370413873091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LN1q2eRAeewQ7kNvwFoPdy4&_nc_oc=Adoh_8Z_-P4LICPKFrg8HvT_i2_yhxDeu6yupLp3KeEoAvxxejNr3GKgRbtAWFqSZbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-tLLCVjog-MSdL--bdFS4y73QBdt74Sux1WR6eUIteFw&oe=6A36BA29"}]}, "id": "838816315903314", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR2.png", "id": "1298204515582726", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1298204518916059_8869792458384025742_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hp8u7ypY8qYQ7kNvwHMhjC2&_nc_oc=Adqz0Rp8WhwIyXwLAmbY1GrEZeQjAnA3E5PJcbKRJLDqy_OMVTorQP74_zk_81tBu6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_8JL4ung35UVkk2x7gEFpYBHqwuyPYqGKu-p0PT12iJQ&oe=6A368E96"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR4.png", "id": "2985541324983450", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_2985541328316783_6181994284030423808_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=njH8NeWE7XcQ7kNvwE1Tmqp&_nc_oc=AdrH_4FLoiLhJCQlp_SRdSFGAh4tNTvStW6HRehtnbGVdEFeHJ2GwIeYnGA6pg01rEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_fMwHBrtH3rvV3OLWmEqwcGuZWo8OmiuTM2TYoxiRreA&oe=6A3698FE"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR5.png", "id": "26075450892156956", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_26075450915490287_155639571789113632_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iIztwTvRXlEQ7kNvwHs8-Ug&_nc_oc=AdqOnyETu-xo4jTBL1nFFHvug0i0IdvKVTW34Ts3XKEm3vdXQYybDPdrWrXMOty-9ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-3F9gfnTW1YJPWi9-dqFRTy9f1_yrkGpguK3esdMCbvw&oe=6A36A6CF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR1.png", "id": "1647149749963491", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_1647149753296824_4887864137137797585_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K5ON0FIezH4Q7kNvwF5acEk&_nc_oc=Adp8YrPDRbFokLyAe5EOwRKqnE-1vUx2alH_RB9fkYEGXHt2bbjNyB5uGD62FMAJgC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-dIh6oP5i9fO0RskLBXGXjIpXPEvvgFWzr_zREpE_UVA&oe=6A369FE1"}, {"file_name": "ScreenshotBSVR3.png", "id": "1582692552837284", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1582692556170617_5582135335785372982_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=efz7cqTRzeQQ7kNvwHmQdTO&_nc_oc=AdqdrHJudLnx_sOVBB2FmwJM03wx9isW-xsLjgzCgxOijHR_IEymArsoNoE9-Yd_jOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_akrwlCCsTQIDPtFF8629wBM9exKqVsCJXSU1W3rhLIA&oe=6A36A4B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bams Solitaire VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to your personal virtual beach. Escape the daily grind with Bams Solitaire VR!\n\nBams Solitaire VR transforms the classic card game into a relaxing getaway. Imagine sitting by a quiet bay, the starry sky shining above you, surrounded by the gentle sound of the ocean, while relaxing music plays from a small beach radio. Right in front of you, your solitaire game floats above the gentle waves.\n\n**Maritime Design Meets Magical Atmosphere**\nEvery detail has been crafted with a love for the sea. Discover our unique, hand-drawn face cards \u2013 from the majestic Sea Queen to Poseidon himself. Play with maritime card backs and let the environment enchant you as a message in a bottle drifts in the water.\n\n**Tangible VR Physics instead of Flat Clicks**\nThanks to our native, highly performant engine, you feel every movement:\n* Perfect Grabbing: Intuitively grab cards or entire stacks with your hands or controllers. Haptic feedback lets you literally feel the weight of the cards.\n* The \"Ninja Flick\": Throw the cards across the table into their target slots with a flick of your wrist!\n* Full Control: Drag the entire playing field into the exact position that is most comfortable for you using the floating control handles.\n\n**Four Classics on One Beach**\nPlay your absolute favorite modes, perfectly adapted for Virtual Reality:\n* Klondike\n* Spider\n* FreeCell\n* Pyramid\n\n**Exclusive VR Features:**\n* Interactive Environment: Turn on the beach radio, read mysterious messages from the bottle,", "short_description": "Relaxing beach solitaire in VR. Listen to the gentle sound of the ocean, grab the cards with your own hands, and enjoy the magic."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bams-design.ch/game/datenschutz.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bams Design", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bams-design.ch/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null